"&formatcharacters; &styles; &columns; &lists; &tabls; &headersfooters; "
"&templatecreation;"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid "Detailed Guides: More than just text"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Up to this point in the documentation, we have been focusing on text. That "
"is about to change!"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:430
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter will discuss inserting a table of contents, graphics, page "
"numbers, links to web pages and how to insert other types of &koffice; data "
"into a document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter will also cover document information and its relationship to "
"document variables."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering Document information"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: index.docbook:434
#, no-c-format
msgid "document information"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kword; can store information about the author and the document in the same "
"file as the text and data of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering this information into &kword; has two potential benefits:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:438
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This information will always be available for reference. This is especially "
"important in situations where there are many possible authors (employees) "
"and hundreds (or thousands) of documents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:440
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The information supplied here, can be inserted automatically into the "
"document as a <link linkend=\"variables\">document variable</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter document information, simply select <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Document Information...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> "
"from the menubar. This will bring up a dialog box with two tabs."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:446
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first tab is labeled <guilabel>General</guilabel>. Enter a document "
"<guilabel>Title</guilabel>, <guilabel>Subject</guilabel> lines, "
"<guilabel>Keywords</guilabel> and an <guilabel>Abstract</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The bottom of this page displays the <guilabel>Type</guilabel> of the "
"document, the date of the creation and modification, the last printing date, "
"the <guilabel>Total editing time</guilabel> and the <guilabel>Revision "
"number</guilabel>. Click on <guibutton>Reset</guibutton> to clear all data "
"and set the actual date as creation date."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Both the document <guilabel>Title</guilabel> and the <guilabel>Abstract</"
"guilabel> can be accessed through<link linkend=\"variables\">document "
"variables</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:449
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second tab is labeled <guilabel>Author</guilabel> and has blanks to "
"enter the authors name, <guilabel>Initials</guilabel>, <guilabel>Title</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Position</guilabel>, <guilabel>Company</guilabel> and "
"contact information (email address, telephone numbers and physical address)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:450
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Every value entered in this dialog can be inserted as a <link linkend="
"\"variables\">document variables</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:452
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the dialog is a button labeled <guibutton>Load From Address "
"Book</guibutton>. Clicking on this button will automatically insert your "
"information contained in the &kde; address book into this &kword; document "
"information dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You must inform the &kde; address book which entry corresponds to your "
"information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To do this, open the &kde; address book, select the entry that contains your "
"name and address. Now select <menuchoice> <guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Set as Personal Contact Data</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>from the menubar in the &kde; address book. This only needs to be "
"performed once."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:456
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kword; will now insert the entered information when the <guibutton>Load "
"From Address Book</guibutton> button is clicked."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:457
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second button <guibutton>Delete Personal Data</guibutton> allows you to "
"remove all data of the entries on this page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When finished entering the information, click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to "
"apply the changes. If any document variables were changed, &kword; will "
"update their values throughout the document."
msgstr ""

